	(text "Every signal into the module is 3.3 V.\nThe module's own 3.3 V output is not used: the board makes its own +3V3A and +3V3D.\nTeensy 4.1 (not 5 V tolerant): cut the VIN–VUSB pads before fitting; VIN takes MOD_5V.\nEvery pin has its hole, so standard full-length headers fit; the ones this board does not use are left open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font (size 1.6 1.6))
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "aac8c58e-56f8-52a4-83ef-ed9ef4c1c912")
	)
